# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads to Cloud Build (job DC). The image build reads .dockerignore as well; this keeps the upload small and keeps secrets and local files out of it.
#!include:.gitignore
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/.next
/docs
/e2e
/tests
/supabase
/scripts
/.claude
**/*.log
